            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka tibarabingiremu Abanyakanaani abaabaire batwire Gezeri; n'ahabw'ekyo Abanyakanaani bakatuura omu Baefuraimu n'okuhitsya eri izooba, kwonka baahinduka abahuuku b'okubakorera.",
          "type": "text",
